# ERROR EXAMPLE: Basis set not available for heavy element
# PbCl2 with Pople basis set — 6-311+G(d,p) does not include parameters for Pb (Z=82)
# Pople basis sets only cover lighter elements; Pb is not parameterized
# ORCA error: "There are no basis functions on atom" or element not found in basis set library
# Fix: Use def2-TZVP (covers the whole periodic table) or assign ECP for Pb
! B3LYP 6-311+G(d,p) Opt Freq pal16

%maxcore 6000

* xyz 0 1
Pb     0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
Cl     2.320000    0.700000    0.000000
Cl    -2.320000    0.700000    0.000000
*
